passive2.description:
While Anastasya is in the party, Stellar Glimmer reactions triggered by any party member gain the following effects:
·**Stellar-Conduct**: The Polestar Field will be further enhanced each time it grants a buff, and creating a Starlight Prism will cause the Field to generate a buff instantly;
·**Stellar Swirl**: Stellar Swirl's base reaction multiplier is increased by 15%. Newly created Stellar Vortices and Drifting Vortices are also immediately raised to Level 2. This level increase can trigger once every 1s.

glossary.description:
For a limited time after another party member's Sealed state ends, selecting that character for the first time triggers this special Elemental Skill instead of switching them in.
**Palestar Edict: Doom** has 3 stages, performed in sequence by selecting the corresponding characters for the first time or pressing the Elemental Skill.
·Stage 1: Performs a series of slashes with the **Blessed Spear: Dolgomernoye**, dealing multiple instances of AoE Cryo DMG that cannot be overridden by other Elemental Infusions and are considered Elemental Skill DMG, followed by a final instance of AoE Cryo DMG that is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG;
·Stage 2: Leaps forward and performs a slash, dealing AoE Cryo DMG that is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG;
·Stage 3: Fires the **Blessed Spear** as an arrow, dealing greater AoE Cryo DMG considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG and ending the Blessed target's [[freeze|Freeze]] effect.
**Radiance: Stellar Glimmer**: The Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG described above is instead dealt as AoE Cryo DMG considered DMG from the corresponding Stellar Glimmer reaction.
